{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your board with a host of new pieces. Start with an aggressive forward assault, Or perhaps a defensive fortress designed to weather the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you outwit, outmanoeuvre, or out-explode your way to victory?<br><br> DEMO gives access to full game, bar access to all the pieces. Which pieces are subject to change, and we aim to give the demo more pieces as the main game has a bigger collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914020/extras/3ca0ffbf3b5ca544853d4f28a0a176c6.avif?t=1754831926\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fusefort: Explodes on capturing/capture, destroying all pieces on that square and to the sides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spearman: pawn who can sidestep and lunge forward to attack 2 spaces ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cracked Pawn: a cheaper &amp; weaker pawn, allowing you to purchase more powerful pieces elsewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warden: A castle that somehow learned to jump, though now he can only reach 2 spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">C4D4: Self-destructs destroying a part of the board for both players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And many more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914020/extras/5f1a4f4c246770f34ee633d60385c4b4.avif?t=1754831926\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Board Forging:</strong> Create custom boards with new layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Pieces:</strong>\u00a011+ new chess pieces and counting, limited use for DEMO</p></li><li><p c